# SPA client-side routing fallback is handled in functions/_middleware.ts.
#
# The classic `/* /index.html 200` rule is intentionally NOT used here:
# current Cloudflare Pages / wrangler versions flag it as an infinite loop
# and silently drop it ("Parsed 0 valid redirect rules"), which breaks deep
# links and page refreshes. The middleware serves index.html for unmatched
# HTML routes instead.
#
# Static assets and /api/* are served directly by Pages, so no rules are needed.
